                        <div class="content">
                           <h2><span>Athletics</span></h2>
                           
                           <p><span>WC is a part of the National Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA) Region 5
                                 with men's basketball, baseball and golf, and women's basketball, softball and tennis.
                                 WC also has a competition rodeo team. For more information about WC's athletic programs
                                 go to <a href="https://www.wcathletics.com">wcathletics.com</a>.</span></p>
                           
                           <h2><span>Intramural Sports</span></h2>
                           
                           <p><span>Intramural Sports provides competitive and recreational tournaments and special events
                                 for all students, regardless of skill level. Sports include volleyball, basketball,
                                 ping pong, and billiards. These activities foster leadership, sportsmanship, and education.</span></p>
                           
